1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,595
Nexez Agent-Ready makes a Shopify catalog legible to AI

2
00:00:03,595 --> 00:00:07,588
agents while keeping the merchant's storefront and
checkout in control.

3
00:00:07,588 --> 00:00:11,183
This walkthrough uses a dedicated development store and
the

4
00:00:11,183 --> 00:00:14,777
prepared Shopify Review Catalog. Reviewer credentials
are supplied privately

5
00:00:14,777 --> 00:00:18,372
in the app submission, so no password or sensitive

6
00:00:18,372 --> 00:00:21,168
account data appears on screen. After installation,

7
00:00:21,168 --> 00:00:24,762
the merchant opens Nexez Agent-Ready directly inside
Shopify admin.

8
00:00:24,762 --> 00:00:27,558
The embedded home shows the connected store,

9
00:00:27,558 --> 00:00:31,152
the selected Nexez listing, and the latest catalog sync.

10
00:00:31,152 --> 00:00:34,747
From one clear workspace, the merchant can change the

11
00:00:34,747 --> 00:00:37,942
destination listing, refresh products, open the theme
integration,

12
00:00:37,942 --> 00:00:41,137
or inspect the same endpoint that agents receive.

13
00:00:41,137 --> 00:00:44,732
Connecting a store is always an explicit merchant
action.

14
00:00:44,732 --> 00:00:47,927
The merchant chooses one of their Nexez listings,

15
00:00:47,927 --> 00:00:51,521
then confirms the connection. Nexez does not silently
attach

16
00:00:51,521 --> 00:00:55,116
a store to an account or restore a previous

17
00:00:55,116 --> 00:00:58,710
listing after an uninstall. One Shopify store can be

18
00:00:58,710 --> 00:01:01,506
active on a listing at a time,

19
00:01:01,506 --> 00:01:04,302
which keeps catalog ownership and attribution clear.

20
00:01:04,302 --> 00:01:07,896
Nexez is a Shopify sales channel. Catalog sync imports

21
00:01:07,896 --> 00:01:11,491
the details agents need to compare an offer accurately.

22
00:01:11,491 --> 00:01:15,085
That includes product names, descriptions, variants,
prices, currency, availability,

23
00:01:15,085 --> 00:01:19,079
and the original Shopify storefront URL. In this review
store,

24
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:21,875
only products published to Nexez.

25
00:01:21,875 --> 00:01:25,469
A single refresh supports up to two hundred and

26
00:01:25,469 --> 00:01:29,064
fifty products, and a failed refresh preserves the
existing

27
00:01:29,064 --> 00:01:32,658
catalog instead of replacing it with incomplete data.
Next,

28
00:01:32,658 --> 00:01:36,253
the merchant enables the lightweight Agent-ready
discovery app embed

29
00:01:36,253 --> 00:01:39,847
in the Shopify theme editor and saves the theme.

30
00:01:39,847 --> 00:01:43,442
The embed publishes discovery links through the store's
configured

31
00:01:43,442 --> 00:01:47,036
app proxy path. It does not replace the storefront,

32
00:01:47,036 --> 00:01:51,030
add a competing checkout, or change the merchant's
visual theme.

33
00:01:51,030 --> 00:01:54,625
It gives compatible agents a stable path to the

34
00:01:54,625 --> 00:01:58,219
structured catalog. Back in Shopify admin, the connected
state

35
00:01:58,219 --> 00:02:01,414
remains available for routine management. Shopify
contextual product-feed

36
00:02:01,414 --> 00:02:04,609
events queue a bounded catalog refresh,

37
00:02:04,609 --> 00:02:08,603
while the Sync now action gives the merchant immediate
control.

38
00:02:08,603 --> 00:02:12,597
The app requests read products, read product listings,
and write app proxy.

39
00:02:12,597 --> 00:02:16,192
It does not request or store customer data or

40
00:02:16,192 --> 00:02:19,786
order data. The resulting Nexez page presents the
business

41
00:02:19,786 --> 00:02:23,381
as a concise, agent-readable catalog. The summary
exposes the

42
00:02:23,381 --> 00:02:26,975
best-fit buyer, offer count, service area, and primary
action.

43
00:02:26,975 --> 00:02:30,170
The linked agent artifact provides structured product
data,

44
00:02:30,170 --> 00:02:33,765
and the public page gives human reviewers a clear

45
00:02:33,765 --> 00:02:37,359
view of the same catalog. Open endpoint returns HTTP 200,

46
00:02:37,359 --> 00:02:40,954
and Shopify App Pricing manages the plan. Each product
preserves

47
00:02:40,954 --> 00:02:44,548
its Shopify source and shows useful commerce details
such

48
00:02:44,548 --> 00:02:48,143
as variants, pricing, and availability. The primary
action returns

49
00:02:48,143 --> 00:02:52,137
the buyer or agent to the original Shopify product page.

50
00:02:52,137 --> 00:02:55,731
Nexez does not process the product purchase or divert

51
00:02:55,731 --> 00:02:59,326
it to another cart. Shopify remains the system of

52
00:02:59,326 --> 00:03:02,920
record for the product and the place where checkout

53
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:06,515
is completed. To recap, Nexez Agent-Ready is a Shopify

54
00:03:06,515 --> 00:03:10,109
sales channel for agent discovery. It imports only
channel-published products,

55
00:03:10,109 --> 00:03:13,304
publishes structured discovery artifacts from the
storefront path,

56
00:03:13,304 --> 00:03:17,298
keeps changes synchronized, and routes product purchases
back to Shopify.

57
00:03:17,298 --> 00:03:21,292
The merchant retains control of the listing, storefront,
customer relationship,

58
00:03:21,292 --> 00:03:23,689
and checkout from start to finish.
